{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30806","headline":"赠淮南将 · 马戴","name":"赠淮南将","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何事淮南将，功高业未成。\n风涛辞海郡，雷雨镇山营。\n度碛黄云起，防秋白发生。\n密机曾制敌，忧国更论兵。\n塞色侵旗动，寒光锁甲明。\n自怜心有作，独立望专征。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"马戴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30806.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30806","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}